12924       * Source: S154 / Chapter 37 / `Getting Started: CAUSALGRAPH Procedure` (PDF pp. 2307–2310); S154 / Chapter 37 / `Overview: CAUSALGRAPH Procedure`
12924    ! (PDF pp. 2304–2307).
